GIVEN `it is more than one sentence` IS A BOOLEAN
      `it is written or printed in standard size text` IS A BOOLEAN
      `it is in C's native language` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Sch 1 para 1: this is complex written information` MEANS
        `it is more than one sentence`
    AND `it is written or printed in standard size text`
    AND `it is in C's native language`

