-- "manage medication ..." means take medication ..., where a failure to do so is likely to result in a
-- deterioration in C's health. (The dots are in the text: words the register marks as removed.)
-- src:520 | “manage medication ...” means take medication ..., where a failure to do so is likely to result in a deterioration in C's health;
@ref Schedule 1, Part 1, para 1 "manage medication" (src:520)
GIVEN `it is taking medication` IS A BOOLEAN
      `a failure to do so is likely to result in a deterioration in C's health` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Sch 1 para 1: this is managing medication` MEANS
        `it is taking medication`
    AND `a failure to do so is likely to result in a deterioration in C's health`

-- "manage therapy" means undertake therapy, where a failure to do so is likely to result in a
