-- src:521 | “manage therapy” means undertake therapy, where a failure to do so is likely to result in a deterioration in C’s health;
@ref Schedule 1, Part 1, para 1 "manage therapy" (src:521)
GIVEN `it is undertaking therapy` IS A BOOLEAN
      `a failure to do so is likely to result in a deterioration in C's health` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Sch 1 para 1: this is managing therapy` MEANS
        `it is undertaking therapy`
    AND `a failure to do so is likely to result in a deterioration in C's health`

-- "medication" means medication to be taken at home which is prescribed or recommended by a
-- registered (a) doctor; (b) nurse; or (c) pharmacist.
-- src:522 | “medication” means medication to be taken at home which is prescribed or recommended by a registered –
-- src:523 | (a) doctor;
-- src:524 | (b) nurse; or
-- src:525 | (c) pharmacist;
@ref Schedule 1, Part 1, para 1 "medication" (src:522-525)
GIVEN `it is to be taken at home` IS A BOOLEAN
      `it is prescribed or recommended by a registered doctor` IS A BOOLEAN
      `it is prescribed or recommended by a registered nurse` IS A BOOLEAN
      `it is prescribed or recommended by a registered pharmacist` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Sch 1 para 1: this is medication` MEANS
        `it is to be taken at home`
    AND (   `it is prescribed or recommended by a registered doctor`
         OR `it is prescribed or recommended by a registered nurse`
         OR `it is prescribed or recommended by a registered pharmacist`)

-- "monitor a health condition" means (a) detect significant changes in C's health condition which are
-- likely to lead to a deterioration in C's health; and (b) take action advised by a (i) registered
-- doctor; (ii) registered nurse; (iii) health professional who is regulated by the Health Professions
-- Council; or (iv) a physician associate registered under the Anaesthesia Associates and Physician
-- Associates Order 2024, without which C's health is likely to deteriorate.
-- src:526 | “ monitor a health condition ” means –
-- src:527 | (a) detect significant changes in C's health condition which are likely to lead to a deterioration in C's health; and
-- src:528 | (b) take action advised by a –
-- src:529 | (i) registered doctor;
-- src:530 | (ii) registered nurse; ...
-- src:531 | (iii) health professional who is regulated by the Health Professions Council ; or
-- src:532 | (iv) a physician associate registered under the Anaesthesia Associates and Physician Associates Order 2024,
-- src:533 | without which C's health is likely to deteriorate;
@ref Schedule 1, Part 1, para 1 "monitor a health condition" (src:526-533)
GIVEN `C detects significant changes in C's health condition which are likely to lead to a deterioration in C's health` IS A BOOLEAN
      `C takes action advised by a registered doctor` IS A BOOLEAN
      `C takes action advised by a registered nurse` IS A BOOLEAN
      `C takes action advised by a health professional regulated by the Health Professions Council` IS A BOOLEAN
      `C takes action advised by a physician associate registered under the Anaesthesia Associates and Physician Associates Order 2024` IS A BOOLEAN
      `without that action C's health is likely to deteriorate` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Sch 1 para 1: C monitors a health condition` MEANS
        `C detects significant changes in C's health condition which are likely to lead to a deterioration in C's health`
    AND (   `C takes action advised by a registered doctor`
         OR `C takes action advised by a registered nurse`
         OR `C takes action advised by a health professional regulated by the Health Professions Council`
         OR `C takes action advised by a physician associate registered under the Anaesthesia Associates and Physician Associates Order 2024`)
    AND `without that action C's health is likely to deteriorate`

