GIVEN `it is getting on and off an unadapted toilet` IS A BOOLEAN
      `it is evacuating the bladder and bowel` IS A BOOLEAN
      `it is cleaning oneself afterwards` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Sch 1 para 1: this is a toilet need` MEANS
       `it is getting on and off an unadapted toilet`
    OR `it is evacuating the bladder and bowel`
    OR `it is cleaning oneself afterwards`
